1
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,611
GREEN DOLPHIN STREET STATE PRISON

2
00:00:37,454 --> 00:00:38,413
Stop right there!

3
00:00:38,496 --> 00:00:39,706
What's going on here?

4
00:00:39,789 --> 00:00:41,666
What are you doing?

5
00:00:44,586 --> 00:00:46,504
ULTRA SECURITY HOUSE UNIT

6
00:00:46,588 --> 00:00:49,591
Prisoner FE40536.

7
00:00:49,674 --> 00:00:51,968
Name, Jolyne Cujoh.

8
00:00:52,051 --> 00:00:55,388
This is the second time
you've caused us trouble.

9
00:00:55,472 --> 00:00:57,182
First, you attempted a jailbreak.

10
00:00:57,265 --> 00:01:00,602
And now, at the prison mausoleum,

11
00:01:00,685 --> 00:01:04,481
a female inmate has been found dead
from blunt force head trauma.

12
00:01:04,564 --> 00:01:08,651
And yet, you refuse to talk
and continue to act defiantly.

13
00:01:09,277 --> 00:01:10,779
For some reason,

14
00:01:10,862 --> 00:01:14,657
violence and death follow you
wherever you go.

15
00:01:14,741 --> 00:01:16,951
We have no proof that you're the culprit,

16
00:01:17,035 --> 00:01:19,913
but you are, without a doubt,
the troublesome type.

17
00:01:23,792 --> 00:01:25,210
Therefore, from now on,

18
00:01:25,293 --> 00:01:27,587
you will be disciplined
according to protocol.

19
00:01:29,422 --> 00:01:31,007
You are hereby confined

20
00:01:31,090 --> 00:01:35,011
for an indefinite amount of time
in this Ultra Security House Unit.

21
00:02:04,332 --> 00:02:05,166
Fuck!

22
00:02:05,834 --> 00:02:08,503
- Fuck!
- There's a woman!

23
00:02:11,673 --> 00:02:13,341
The newcomer's a woman!

24
00:02:13,424 --> 00:02:16,469
I smell a woman!

25
00:02:16,553 --> 00:02:20,140
Her smell is seeping out under the door!

26
00:02:23,434 --> 00:02:24,686
What the hell?

27
00:02:25,353 --> 00:02:27,105
Yes!

28
00:02:27,188 --> 00:02:30,191
I got shit on her face!

29
00:02:30,733 --> 00:02:34,571
My own shit, on a woman's face!

30
00:02:35,155 --> 00:02:37,991
I want to bash her up too!

31
00:02:39,909 --> 00:02:43,830
One thing that must not happen here
is the exhaustion of my mental strength.

32
00:02:44,414 --> 00:02:48,209
The unnecessary stress
and the physical toll it takes.

33
00:02:49,377 --> 00:02:55,466
There is something I must accomplish
in this Ultra Security House Unit!

34
00:02:58,887 --> 00:03:00,471
I must succeed, no matter what.

35
00:03:01,389 --> 00:03:05,310
And for that, I must not waste any energy.

36
00:03:07,353 --> 00:03:08,354
No.

37
00:03:08,855 --> 00:03:10,982
I will grow even stronger!

38
00:03:19,073 --> 00:03:22,493
It may be possible to attain heaven.

39
00:03:23,202 --> 00:03:24,454
23 YEARS AGO

40
00:03:24,537 --> 00:03:27,165
Hey, don't look so glum.

41
00:03:27,248 --> 00:03:29,417
I'm not talking about death.

42
00:03:30,001 --> 00:03:32,295
The heaven I'm talking about

43
00:03:32,378 --> 00:03:34,422
has to do with the soul.

44
00:03:35,089 --> 00:03:36,799
The place our soul travels to.

45
00:03:36,883 --> 00:03:39,802
The power of our soul
must surely evolve there.

46
00:03:39,886 --> 00:03:42,764
I'm talking about
the final form of our souls.

47
00:03:43,389 --> 00:03:46,935
Surely, you, out of anyone else
are able to comprehend.

48
00:03:47,936 --> 00:03:50,521
True happiness lies there.

49
00:03:50,605 --> 00:03:53,191
But this is contingent upon
attaining heaven.

50
00:03:53,775 --> 00:03:55,026
I know happiness is not attained

51
00:03:55,109 --> 00:03:57,862
by obtaining the mightiest body,
having lots of money,

52
00:03:57,946 --> 00:04:02,158
or having dominion over others.

53
00:04:02,825 --> 00:04:04,786
True victory

54
00:04:04,869 --> 00:04:06,955
belongs to those who have seen heaven.

55
00:04:09,499 --> 00:04:11,084
I will do everything…

56
00:04:13,294 --> 00:04:15,630
…to reach that end.

57
00:05:50,433 --> 00:05:52,810
Let's say I place
this sticker on this pen.

58
00:05:52,894 --> 00:05:53,895
EPISODE 13: SMACK OF LOVE AND REVENGE (1)

59
00:05:53,978 --> 00:05:57,023
It then creates a copy of the pen.

60
00:05:58,024 --> 00:05:59,484
This is my ability.

61
00:06:00,234 --> 00:06:02,028
I call it Smack.

62
00:06:02,111 --> 00:06:03,321
Peel the sticker off, and…

63
00:06:05,239 --> 00:06:08,076
the pen fuses back together
with force, leaving a fissure.

64
00:06:08,159 --> 00:06:09,827
It is now easier to destroy.

65
00:06:10,495 --> 00:06:15,041
I take this ability as my sign from God.

66
00:06:22,965 --> 00:06:24,425
He'll remember in no time

67
00:06:25,593 --> 00:06:28,721
that this seal of kiss
is my license for revenge.

68
00:06:30,056 --> 00:06:32,517
Good morning, Father.

69
00:06:33,226 --> 00:06:36,562
May I have one of these flowers?

70
00:06:36,646 --> 00:06:39,273
I've grown a fondness for them recently.

71
00:06:39,357 --> 00:06:41,484
Of course, feel free to take it.

72
00:06:41,567 --> 00:06:43,694
Sports Maximum.

73
00:06:54,872 --> 00:06:57,375
F.F., she's cutting in front of you.

74
00:06:58,376 --> 00:07:00,795
Hey, I said she cut in line.

75
00:07:00,878 --> 00:07:01,921
I know.

76
00:07:02,922 --> 00:07:03,923
For some reason,

77
00:07:04,006 --> 00:07:07,176
I feel like the others
don't accept me here.

78
00:07:07,260 --> 00:07:09,262
It's like they're looking down on me.

79
00:07:10,138 --> 00:07:11,764
Don't cut, dumbass!

80
00:07:11,848 --> 00:07:12,932
Tell her off.

81
00:07:13,015 --> 00:07:15,017
I disagree with you.

82
00:07:15,726 --> 00:07:17,395
It's not good to force something.

83
00:07:18,229 --> 00:07:21,232
You have to change yourself
before seeking approval from others.

84
00:07:21,315 --> 00:07:22,150
Isn't that right?

85
00:07:22,692 --> 00:07:26,571
So, I decided to do the exact opposite
of what I usually do.

86
00:07:27,947 --> 00:07:29,574
What's the opposite of coffee?

87
00:07:29,657 --> 00:07:30,616
Tea?

88
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:35,204
That's right. Atroe's body,
which I took over, is craving coffee.

89
00:07:35,288 --> 00:07:36,789
So I go with tea instead.

90
00:07:37,373 --> 00:07:38,207
On purpose.

91
00:07:42,295 --> 00:07:43,254
Does that make sense?

92
00:07:45,756 --> 00:07:48,342
Instead of bread, I eat rice.

93
00:07:48,426 --> 00:07:52,221
Use my non-dominant left hand
instead of my right hand to eat.

94
00:07:52,847 --> 00:07:55,766
I'm trying to change myself
by doing the exact opposite.

95
00:07:55,850 --> 00:07:57,602
Listen, F.F.

96
00:07:57,685 --> 00:08:00,146
The wound where I got shot…

97
00:08:01,147 --> 00:08:02,857
It hurts like hell.

98
00:08:02,940 --> 00:08:04,192
I told you.

99
00:08:04,275 --> 00:08:06,819
I can only fill the holes with plankton.

100
00:08:06,903 --> 00:08:09,572
The rest is up to
your body's ability to heal.

101
00:08:09,655 --> 00:08:11,199
- Got that?
- Damn.

102
00:08:12,617 --> 00:08:15,411
Jolyne, what's the opposite of pork?

103
00:08:15,495 --> 00:08:17,163
Maybe chicken, or even beef.

104
00:08:17,246 --> 00:08:19,665
The opposite of pork is salmon.

105
00:08:19,749 --> 00:08:21,792
Pigs lie around in mud all day.

106
00:08:21,876 --> 00:08:24,670
Salmons swim against the current
to go upstream.

107
00:08:25,421 --> 00:08:26,631
I love that.

108
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:28,883
They're cutting again.

109
00:08:28,966 --> 00:08:31,594
Scram, bitch! Come on, tell them off!

110
00:08:31,677 --> 00:08:34,347
Like I said, I'm trying
the exact opposite.

111
00:08:34,972 --> 00:08:36,682
Like dragging people into the line.

112
00:08:36,766 --> 00:08:38,684
Come along now, right here.

113
00:08:38,768 --> 00:08:40,353
What's the matter with you?

114
00:08:40,436 --> 00:08:42,355
I won't let you cut in front of me.

115
00:08:42,438 --> 00:08:43,856
Don't touch me, bitch.

116
00:08:43,940 --> 00:08:45,942
Go to the back, dumbass!

117
00:08:46,025 --> 00:08:48,110
What did you call me, bitch?

118
00:08:48,194 --> 00:08:50,238
- The hell?
- Look at that.

119
00:08:50,321 --> 00:08:52,657
It's so much easier to grab food now.
Easy as pie.

120
00:08:56,619 --> 00:08:59,413
By the way, where's Ermes?

121
00:08:59,497 --> 00:09:01,958
I haven't seen her for a few days.

122
00:09:02,041 --> 00:09:04,043
Haven't you heard?

123
00:09:07,171 --> 00:09:08,881
She's following a man?

124
00:09:08,965 --> 00:09:10,424
Is Ermes really doing that?

125
00:09:10,508 --> 00:09:13,219
Yeah. Every morning for a while now.

126
00:09:13,302 --> 00:09:17,098
Even when you got shot, Jolyne.

127
00:09:21,310 --> 00:09:23,145
I haven't seen Jolyne.

128
00:09:23,229 --> 00:09:25,189
Something's going on in the courtyard.
Looks bad.

129
00:09:28,609 --> 00:09:30,611
Hey, Ermes!

130
00:09:32,321 --> 00:09:34,490
Leave her be.

131
00:09:37,785 --> 00:09:40,246
The inmate Ermes is tailing?

132
00:09:40,329 --> 00:09:43,207
Yes. You know all the rumors around here.

133
00:09:43,291 --> 00:09:44,584
That's correct.

134
00:09:44,667 --> 00:09:47,044
I'm honored you came to me, Jolyne.

135
00:09:48,713 --> 00:09:52,466
Oh, you don't expect me
to tell you for free, right?

136
00:09:53,175 --> 00:09:54,760
An information fee.

137
00:09:54,844 --> 00:09:57,179
I'll give you a friend's discount.

138
00:10:05,479 --> 00:10:06,314
Found it.

139
00:10:07,356 --> 00:10:12,111
"The body of a female thought to have been
caught in the crossfire of gang violence

140
00:10:12,194 --> 00:10:14,280
was found by the river before dawn."

141
00:10:14,363 --> 00:10:15,906
Florida's local papers.

142
00:10:15,990 --> 00:10:17,575
It's dated six years ago.

143
00:10:17,658 --> 00:10:20,119
It's exactly as Gwess said.

144
00:10:22,246 --> 00:10:23,831
Gloria Costello.

145
00:10:23,914 --> 00:10:26,542
So she is Ermes's older sister.

146
00:10:28,628 --> 00:10:29,962
THE NEXT DAY

147
00:10:31,756 --> 00:10:33,841
Over the last few days,

148
00:10:33,924 --> 00:10:35,468
I've waited for the right time

149
00:10:35,551 --> 00:10:37,845
 as I watched you, carefully and closely.

150
00:10:39,180 --> 00:10:41,223
I don't know what caused you
to change your heart,

151
00:10:41,307 --> 00:10:44,894
but I watched you sweeping
the old prison's graveyard.

152
00:10:44,977 --> 00:10:47,188
You also left flowers at a grave.

153
00:10:47,813 --> 00:10:49,649
Were they for your fellow gang members

154
00:10:49,732 --> 00:10:51,567
who were executed in the electric chair?

155
00:10:53,110 --> 00:10:55,071
I also watched you

156
00:10:55,154 --> 00:10:58,699
making taxidermy birds and alligators
in the prison's workshop.

157
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:03,746
Now, why would a grunt like you take up
a sudden interest in such a hobby?

158
00:11:04,705 --> 00:11:06,624
Well, none of that matters.

159
00:11:07,375 --> 00:11:11,128
But there's one thing I must know.

160
00:11:14,256 --> 00:11:16,050
Jolyne, F.F.

161
00:11:16,133 --> 00:11:18,260
You seem well, Ermes.

162
00:11:18,969 --> 00:11:21,305
Here you go. Your share of breakfast.

163
00:11:24,433 --> 00:11:25,559
Ermes,

164
00:11:25,643 --> 00:11:27,728
about that man you are following…

165
00:11:27,812 --> 00:11:30,064
Following? I don't know what you mean.

166
00:11:30,648 --> 00:11:31,816
Don't play stupid.

167
00:11:32,608 --> 00:11:34,777
His name is Sports Maximum.

168
00:11:34,860 --> 00:11:37,029
He is a notorious gangster
in the outside world.

169
00:11:37,113 --> 00:11:39,407
But now, he is incarcerated
in the male wing here.

170
00:11:39,490 --> 00:11:42,785
Is that so? Not that it concerns me.

171
00:11:42,868 --> 00:11:43,828
Ermes.

172
00:11:43,911 --> 00:11:49,083
You were sent here at Green Dolphin
for armed robbery.

173
00:11:51,127 --> 00:11:54,547
Did you do that just to become
a convict at this facility?

174
00:11:55,548 --> 00:11:59,176
For you to exact revenge on Sports Maximum
for your sister's death.

175
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:00,678
Jolyne.

176
00:12:00,761 --> 00:12:03,139
You don't pry into
other people's business in prison.

177
00:12:03,222 --> 00:12:04,432
Really?

178
00:12:04,515 --> 00:12:07,518
Well, I'm doing opposites today.

179
00:12:10,563 --> 00:12:12,231
I don't need you to butt in.

180
00:12:12,314 --> 00:12:13,774
Go back to the female wing.

181
00:12:16,277 --> 00:12:18,946
Ermes is right, Jolyne.

182
00:12:19,029 --> 00:12:21,198
You have your own mission to worry about.

183
00:12:22,199 --> 00:12:23,409
I know.

184
00:12:25,369 --> 00:12:27,037
Just a little longer, Gloria.

185
00:12:28,205 --> 00:12:31,041
I'll avenge you with my own hands.

186
00:12:35,546 --> 00:12:36,881
Ermes.

187
00:12:37,465 --> 00:12:40,551
Think of me as your mother from now on.

188
00:12:46,140 --> 00:12:47,558
From that day on,

189
00:12:48,267 --> 00:12:49,518
Gloria…

190
00:12:49,602 --> 00:12:53,898
you always put the family first.

191
00:12:55,316 --> 00:12:56,484
Ermes.

192
00:12:56,567 --> 00:12:59,195
You can help at the store
sometimes, you know.

193
00:12:59,278 --> 00:13:04,366
I want you to inherit
your father's restaurant with me.

194
00:13:04,450 --> 00:13:07,244
The hell should I care.
I'm getting out of here.

195
00:13:07,745 --> 00:13:10,831
I want to get a cross-country scholarship
and go to college.

196
00:13:11,499 --> 00:13:13,876
Don't act all high and mighty
and tell me what to do.

197
00:13:13,959 --> 00:13:15,044
Ermes!

198
00:13:16,962 --> 00:13:17,796
Don't leave!

199
00:13:31,352 --> 00:13:33,145
Help me…

200
00:13:34,313 --> 00:13:37,942
Fetch me that thick stick with your mouth.

201
00:13:38,025 --> 00:13:42,321
Not like a dog, but as a baby would do it.

202
00:13:59,755 --> 00:14:02,174
I'm not interested in seeing
what lies in the dark.

203
00:14:02,258 --> 00:14:04,552
I wouldn't report it
to the authorities either.

204
00:14:05,386 --> 00:14:08,889
The darkness will handle
those who live by it. 

205
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:14,603
That's the only way to keep
a restaurant open in that city.

206
00:14:15,187 --> 00:14:16,272
But that night…

207
00:14:27,324 --> 00:14:32,329
Gloria had no choice but to put herself
in danger and call the police.

208
00:14:32,413 --> 00:14:34,248
She did it to protect me.

209
00:14:34,915 --> 00:14:35,875
But even then…

210
00:14:37,918 --> 00:14:40,170
Defendant Sports Maximum,

211
00:14:40,254 --> 00:14:42,423
you are hereby sentenced
to five years in prison

212
00:14:42,506 --> 00:14:43,632
for tax evasion and assault.

213
00:14:44,758 --> 00:14:47,344
Five years? Only five years?

214
00:14:48,888 --> 00:14:51,974
We can't corner him with a weak witness.

215
00:14:52,808 --> 00:14:54,351
This is the best we can do.

216
00:14:54,435 --> 00:14:56,562
He had her killed!

217
00:14:56,645 --> 00:14:58,397
He destroyed all evidence of that.

218
00:15:00,941 --> 00:15:02,443
Bullshit.

219
00:15:02,526 --> 00:15:04,278
- Wait. Wait, dammit!
- Stay put!

220
00:15:07,740 --> 00:15:10,075
Fucking bastard!

221
00:15:27,718 --> 00:15:29,553
So you do remember her.

222
00:15:29,637 --> 00:15:31,180
That's right.

223
00:15:32,598 --> 00:15:34,183
You must not forget Gloria.

224
00:15:36,727 --> 00:15:39,521
Gloria!

225
00:15:47,655 --> 00:15:50,908
I've been waiting for this chance.

226
00:15:50,991 --> 00:15:56,038
I've been waiting for you to be alone
so no one can hear your screams.

227
00:15:56,121 --> 00:15:59,249
That's what I've been wanting to know.

228
00:15:59,750 --> 00:16:02,503
The things you made Gloria suffer through.

229
00:16:03,462 --> 00:16:04,838
Sports Maximum.

230
00:16:05,506 --> 00:16:08,258
I'll make you remember them!

231
00:16:13,222 --> 00:16:14,890
STAND NAME: SMACK
STAND MASTER: ERMES COSTELLO

232
00:16:18,477 --> 00:16:19,979
The hell is this?

233
00:16:20,062 --> 00:16:22,147
What are you doing to me, bitch?

234
00:16:22,231 --> 00:16:25,275
Your sentence ends in about a year.

235
00:16:25,359 --> 00:16:27,820
Once you're free, you'll have bodyguards.

236
00:16:28,737 --> 00:16:30,781
But you are defenseless in here!

237
00:16:33,325 --> 00:16:35,703
Yes. It's a perfect fit for you.

238
00:16:35,786 --> 00:16:40,582
It's true that prison pipes are not
big enough to fit a human being.

239
00:16:41,166 --> 00:16:44,670
But that means
it fits you perfectly as a coffin.

240
00:16:46,547 --> 00:16:48,382
Is that the sound of you falling down?

241
00:16:48,465 --> 00:16:49,925
Hey, help me out.

242
00:16:50,009 --> 00:16:51,468
Who the hell are you?

243
00:16:51,552 --> 00:16:53,637
Let me out, now!

244
00:16:53,721 --> 00:16:57,850
- You still don't understand who I am?
- What?

245
00:16:57,933 --> 00:17:00,853
Take the last few moments of your life
to think it through.

246
00:17:01,353 --> 00:17:03,814
You left Gloria's body in the gutter.

247
00:17:04,565 --> 00:17:07,651
And her suffering drove my father ill.

248
00:17:08,318 --> 00:17:09,611
I…

249
00:17:09,695 --> 00:17:11,155
lost everything.

250
00:17:12,573 --> 00:17:15,826
Beg them for forgiveness in hell,
Sports Maximum!

251
00:17:16,326 --> 00:17:19,830
If you can with that mouth
full of wastewater, that is!

252
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:26,920
I placed a second sticker on the pipe.

253
00:17:27,504 --> 00:17:30,257
It'll be a lid for this coffin.

254
00:17:33,218 --> 00:17:34,887
It's completely closed now.

255
00:17:34,970 --> 00:17:37,931
Now, scream all you want.

256
00:17:38,015 --> 00:17:40,809
- You bitch!
- Go on, call for help.

257
00:17:40,893 --> 00:17:45,147
Only cockroaches and rats will hear you.

258
00:17:47,941 --> 00:17:50,402
You belong in the gutter, bastard.

259
00:17:50,486 --> 00:17:53,530
Now try to scream, Sports Maximum!

260
00:17:55,199 --> 00:18:01,997
Those who rise from the darkness,
Limp Viscuit… Come forth and join me…

261
00:18:03,248 --> 00:18:09,254
We will share joy
in the darkness, Limp Viscuit…

262
00:18:27,940 --> 00:18:29,274
Something's there.

263
00:18:29,900 --> 00:18:32,319
It's coming towards me.

264
00:18:38,367 --> 00:18:40,369
This attack!

265
00:18:40,452 --> 00:18:41,328
It can't be!

266
00:18:41,411 --> 00:18:42,788
Sports Maximum can't be…

267
00:18:56,385 --> 00:18:58,053
Fuck, my finger.

268
00:18:59,596 --> 00:19:00,931
He's using a Stand ability.

269
00:19:01,014 --> 00:19:03,684
I don't understand why I can't see it,

270
00:19:03,767 --> 00:19:06,103
but I definitely felt its form.

271
00:19:06,603 --> 00:19:07,980
It was bird-shaped!

272
00:19:14,653 --> 00:19:16,155
Sticker…

273
00:19:28,834 --> 00:19:31,837
Did I win? Did I crush it?

274
00:19:32,963 --> 00:19:36,300
I couldn't have known that
he gained a Stand ability.

275
00:19:36,383 --> 00:19:37,467
How's that?

276
00:19:38,093 --> 00:19:41,221
Sports Maximum, you've gone quiet.

277
00:19:41,305 --> 00:19:44,141
Did you get crushed inside that pipe?

278
00:19:45,184 --> 00:19:48,478
Or did the filthy water fill you up
from your mouth to your asshole,

279
00:19:48,562 --> 00:19:51,023
drowning you to death?

280
00:20:16,340 --> 00:20:18,467
What is it now?

281
00:20:21,386 --> 00:20:24,348
Is Sports Maximum still alive?

282
00:20:24,890 --> 00:20:27,726
He must still be alive in that pipe,

283
00:20:27,809 --> 00:20:29,895
hence this strange unseen power.

284
00:20:38,111 --> 00:20:40,239
It's bigger than the last one.

285
00:20:44,243 --> 00:20:45,118
It's fast!

286
00:20:52,292 --> 00:20:53,293
This power…

287
00:20:53,377 --> 00:20:56,797
Could it be the stuffed alligator
from the workshop?

288
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,715
Earlier, that was…

289
00:20:59,883 --> 00:21:02,344
the bird's corpse moving around.

290
00:21:02,427 --> 00:21:04,763
The invisible corpses
have gained the power to move.

291
00:21:04,846 --> 00:21:07,224
They're the ones attacking me!

292
00:21:08,308 --> 00:21:09,977
That bastard.

293
00:21:10,060 --> 00:21:12,271
He's trying to bust the pipe
and break free!

294
00:21:12,354 --> 00:21:13,689
Ermes.

295
00:21:14,690 --> 00:21:16,316
Why are you up there?

296
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:17,818
Ermes.

297
00:21:17,901 --> 00:21:19,444
Jolyne is worried about you--

298
00:21:19,528 --> 00:21:22,864
Jolyne, F.F, don't come any closer!

299
00:21:31,123 --> 00:21:33,458
- F.F!
- There's an enemy.

300
00:21:33,542 --> 00:21:34,543
There's an alligator.

301
00:21:35,127 --> 00:21:38,171
Invisible, dead beasts
are crawling around!

302
00:21:45,971 --> 00:21:47,806
Damn, it got my leg.

303
00:21:47,889 --> 00:21:50,726
Ermes, just what is happening here?

304
00:21:50,809 --> 00:21:53,562
- Is this a Stand attack?
- That's right.

305
00:21:53,645 --> 00:21:55,397
It's that bastard, Sports Maximum.

306
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:58,859
He gained a Stand ability
without me knowing…

307
00:22:01,361 --> 00:22:03,739
Run! It's charging towards you!

308
00:22:04,323 --> 00:22:06,491
It's already on the move!

309
00:22:06,575 --> 00:22:07,868
Stone Ocean!

310
00:23:41,336 --> 00:23:46,341
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
